  "description": "Ace Lampard has it all- looks, charm, grades, and the attention of the entire school. He sits at the top of every social and academic ladder. That is, until a new transfer student, Colin McCarthy, unexpectedly takes the top academic spot and turns everything upside down. Colin is shy, awkward, and completely out of place. After Ace steps in to protect him from bullies, Colin becomes infatuated and starts following him in secret. When Ace catches on, Colin prepares himself for rejection. Instead, he hears something completely unexpected.\n\n *“Be my Secret lover, Colin...”* \n\nWhat begins as a strange proposal slowly unravels into something much more dangerous. He isn’t just an ordinary student with a crush. He has a reason for being here, and Ace is only the beginning.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
